Toolchains and platform code NOT redistributed here
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Board builds link against the Arduino core for the Renesas RA4M1 (and, at
M6, the Teensy and ESP32 cores). Those are fetched by PlatformIO at build
time under their own licences and no part of them is contained in this
repository. `firmware/hal/renesas_ra4m1.cpp` calls that core's public API;
it does not copy it.

Renode, used to run the firmware on an emulated board in CI, is likewise a
build/test dependency and is not redistributed here.
